    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nAdverse Effects (3) : Mannitol\n\n(1) Pulmonary edema\n(2) Exacerbate heart failure\n\n(3) Altered Na+ levels\n\n(↑ Serum osmolarity draws fluid from CSF/eyes, but this can dilute serum sodium and increase cardiac afterload)\n\n[Image: dc2fbd7388743ed39d99b5d0250528c460b9bc4709ef8feb5db9864bc5132303]\n\n[Image: da8c6fd2bb02262cabd3eb7dd1afc6754f692528494daec732453d17f177c9a3]\n\n[Image: 61334e7a23ff73ca1ea661eebed69bd0310b341ef431237c6919e7e5dba27981]\n\n2.1 - Acetazolamide, mannitol\n[Image: c346f1e1d5cb39cc059e5bd608d36a8812b1c3b530d0e01775017287fe4fe311]\n\n[Image: 61f8a0910486f3c71a4efb2db6dbb10d3bbc0bb7fb66229bb099924aa115e650]\n\n[Image: b76e775466426f4d4e1061c1f6bca824ec6b4d679966f6f7153af8a9243e768b]",
